# genealogy-source-ingestion

---
name: genealogy-source-ingestion
description: "Ingests raw genealogical source documents (PDFs, census images, birth/baptismal certificates, military registers) from Sources/_Inbox/ and online repositories, applies ADR-GEN-026 space-free canonical naming, organizes holdings into the 2-tier archival taxonomy (Vital_Statistics/Births, Census/US, etc.), binds Tri-Tier assets (Master, Display, Inference) to a single markdown companion note, consolidates multi-page records into sequential Page 1/Page 2 layouts, enforces auto-aliasing, and enforces the Basename WikiLink Invariant per ADR-GEN-023 and SOP-GEN-011."
